  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital transformation and Sustainable growth Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Transformacin digital y Crecimiento Sostenible</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es impulsar una mejora en la competitividad de Chile que promueva el crecimiento sostenible e inclusivo. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) acelerar la transformacin digital de los servicios pblicos, as como la conectividad digital; (ii) promover la transicin hacia modelos circulares de produccin y consumo; y (iii) promover, con especial nfasis en las mujeres, la recuperacin y formalizacin del empleo mediante el apoyo a las PYME, el estmulo a la contratacin y la capacitacin focalizada de la fuerza laboral.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to promote an improvement in Chile&apos;s competitiveness that promotes sustainable and inclusive growth. The specific objectives are: (i) accelerate the digital transformation of public services, as well as digital connectivity; (ii) promote the transition to circular models of production and consumption; and (iii) promote, with special emphasis on women, the recovery and formalization of employment through support for SMEs, stimulation of hiring, and targeted training of the workforce.</narrative>
  </description>
